('reconstruction-2026-11-04', 'weeknd-2026-11-04', '2026-11-04'::date, 'eventRoadUplift', '[1,1,1,1,1,3,3.5,4,4.5,5,6,7,7,7,7,7,6,5,4,2.5]'::jsonb, '[1,1,1,1,1,2.1,2.45,2.8,3.15,3.5,4.2,4.9,4.9,4.9,4.9,4.9,4.2,3.5,2.8,1.75]'::jsonb, '[1.3,1.3,1.3,1.3,1.3,3.9,4.55,5.2,5.85,6.5,7.8,9.1,9.1,9.1,9.1,9.1,7.8,6.5,5.2,3.25]'::jsonb, '× road time', 'Concert parking was set up at MRANTI Park and gates opened in the afternoon, so traffic around LRT Bukit Jalil built from about noon. Local reports for 4 Nov describe gridlock until about 2:00 am. The curve rises from 12:00 and peaks in the evening.', 'medium', 'gemini-3.8-flash (pre-written)', false, '2026-11-05T09:00:00+08:00'::timestamptz),
